+    "world_coordinates": "Player centers are public color-9 bounding-box midpoints. Camera y is anchored by known public color-8 switch world centers when visible and otherwise updated by consecutive public-grid registration; every reported coordinate came from numeric output in this session.",
+    "reproduction": "Direct return value of carnot.agentic.arc_solver_kit.reproduce plus five separately constructed plain-loop replays.",
+    "step_accounting": "Additive ledger of every public offline env.step issued this session, including failed hypotheses and every replayed prefix; scored/live-network steps are separately and truthfully zero.",
+    "privacy_boundary": "No bp35 implementation source, env._game, internal state object, importlib execution, set_level, teleport, or private-state verifier was read or invoked."
+  }
+}
